  "source_title": "十座最有文人气的名亭，榜首不是醉翁亭也不是爱晚亭——它是四十一人、一场聚会、一篇文章立下的。 #中国名亭 #兰亭 #文人气 #醉翁亭 #历史文化",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 448.493991,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "您知道中国古代最有文人气的名亭都有哪些吗？上集，咱们聊了真趣亭吹台放鹤亭风、乐亭沧浪亭那场直接揭开谜底，看看前五名文雅到什么程度，尤其是排在榜首的那座，哪怕亭子在历史上屡遭冰火损毁，哪要有人提笔沾墨那场流觞曲水的浩荡兰香，就立刻在字里行间活了过来。老规矩，开讲之前，劳烦您扣个一点个红心，让我看看都是谁在听第五名，爱婉亭。在湖南长沙岳麓山的清风峡里，他修在清朝乾隆年间，原先叫红叶亭，高九米，顶上铺着绿油油的琉璃瓦，八根红大柱子，稳稳顶着四角飞檐。后来的关缘取杜牧停车坐爱枫林晚的名句，改名叫爱婉亭。您要是秋天去傍晚的光打在红叶上风一过，叶子落进亭子里。杜牧那句诗就在脑子里自己跑出来了。这不是背课文，这是脚踩进诗里的感觉。年轻世子在这儿指点江山，激扬文字，诗情，融进山水，文胆皆续文脉。在这站上一炷香的功夫，整个人都被书卷墨香浸透了。您说他能不流传千古吗？第四名，陶然亭在北京城南先农坛的西边，清朝康熙年间，一位管工程的官员江早在这盖了三间小草亭，借白居易共君一醉一桃然的诗句，给他起了名字。在整整两百多年里，各地进京赶考的举子文人只要科举落了榜，或者要卷铺盖离开京城，全都会跑到这儿来借酒浇愁。您说这样的地方，它哪里只是一座亭？他是北京文人两百年的出气口，落脚点散心的地方。第三名，湖心亭就站在西湖正中央。四面都是水，四面都是山，夏天来是热闹，冬天落了大雪，就是另一个世界张岱。在湖心亭看学里写过崇祯五年，大雪下了三天，他半夜一个人撑着小船，出门看雪山是白的，亭是白的，天地之间像是被抹平了。到了亭上，居然还有两个人，三个人围着炉子，把酒喝完各自散的，连名字都没留。这篇文章不到两百字，却是中国文学史上写孤独写的最干净的一篇张岱是在明朝亡了之后，借着旧日的雪重写，回不去的那个世界。湖心亭的文人气是孤独到极致，却又孤独的那么干净。第二名，醉翁亭在安徽滁州的狼牙山腰上，北宋庆历年间，琅牙寺的和尚特意为欧阳修盖了这座歇山小青瓦亭，远远看去就像一只展翅的大鸟，立在泉水边上。醉翁亭不大，在山边旁边有古树遮阴，一进去就凉。欧阳修在这儿不是一个人喝闷酒，他是带着老百姓一起来的。游山宴隐看、射、听音乐，热热闹闹，把被贬的日子过成了嘉年华。这种豁达不是装出来的，是他真的把与民同乐这四个字落了。后来，宋朝文人但凡提到贬官文化必提，欧阳修必提醉翁亭一篇记一座亭，让醉翁这两个字从贬义变成了境界。您说这样的亭子应不应该晋榜？可就算是醉翁亭在文人气这件事上，也还有一座亭子排在他前面。第一名，兰亭在浙江绍兴的兰竹山脚下，为什么是他在他面前所有的亭子都只能算后辈？公元三百五十三年三月初，三东晋永和九年，会稽内使王羲之邀集谢安孙绰等四十一位文人名士在兰主山下取水流觞。饮酒作诗，王羲之带着微醺醉意，拿起蜀虚笔，在残简纸上一气呵成，写下了被誉为天下第一行书的兰亭集序。两千多年来，任凭兵荒马乱，朝代更迭多少殿堂楼阁化为灰烬。兰亭园址也历经多次迁建，可兰亭这两个字，早就从从一座具体的江南牧亭化作了全体中国文人心头不灭的图腾。您坐在兰亭的鹅池边上，看着眼前蜿蜒的溪流，听着竹林里的清风细雨。当年那群魏晋风流名仕听对生死无常发出的喟叹，至今依然顺着流水撞击在您的心口。它排在榜首，不是因为建筑有多宏伟，而是是因为在这座亭子下诞生的风骨与墨香，直接定义了中国传统文人的最高精神品格。十座名亭全讲完了，真趣亭带着江南的灵动吹台，把湖光山色悄悄借走。放鹤亭带人逃离官场牢笼。丰乐亭装满了天下人的保暖。沧浪亭立着不肯服软的骨气，艾婉亭染透了书卷，诗意陶然亭盛满了游子的心酸。醉翁亭教人看淡人生的起落，湖心亭，守着血液里的一腔孤傲，可只有兰亭不是一个人的故事，而是四十一个人共同立下的一块碑。他告诉所有文人，什么叫真正的惧，什么叫真正的雅？什么叫把一个好日子过成往后一千年的标准？您说什么叫文人气？最顶级的文人气，从来不是雕梁画栋，修的有多气派，而是即便肉身化作尘土，那股寄情山水、超然物外的精神香火，依然能在后人心中代代相传。最后问您一句，这十座亭子，您去过哪几座哪一座最让您记得住，想听更多中国古代的山水与文人。点个关注，咱们下回接着聊。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00001",
      "start_ms": 290,
      "end_ms": 4710,
      "text": "您知道中国古代最有文人气的名亭都有哪些吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00002",
      "start_ms": 5170,
      "end_ms": 5730,
      "text": "上集，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00003",
      "start_ms": 5810,
      "end_ms": 15370,
      "text": "咱们聊了真趣亭吹台放鹤亭风、乐亭沧浪亭那场直接揭开谜底，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00004",
      "start_ms": 15770,
      "end_ms": 18050,
      "text": "看看前五名文雅到什么程度，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00005",
      "start_ms": 18490,
      "end_ms": 20630,
      "text": "尤其是排在榜首的那座，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00006",
      "start_ms": 21050,
      "end_ms": 24450,
      "text": "哪怕亭子在历史上屡遭冰火损毁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00007",
      "start_ms": 24970,
      "end_ms": 29875,
      "text": "哪要有人提笔沾墨那场流觞曲水的浩荡兰香，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00008",
      "start_ms": 30360,
      "end_ms": 32740,
      "text": "就立刻在字里行间活了过来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00009",
      "start_ms": 33080,
      "end_ms": 33760,
      "text": "老规矩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00010",
      "start_ms": 34040,
      "end_ms": 35020,
      "text": "开讲之前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00011",
      "start_ms": 35080,
      "end_ms": 37760,
      "text": "劳烦您扣个一点个红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00012",
      "start_ms": 38260,
      "end_ms": 41300,
      "text": "让我看看都是谁在听第五名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00013",
      "start_ms": 41640,
      "end_ms": 42380,
      "text": "爱婉亭。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00014",
      "start_ms": 42880,
      "end_ms": 45840,
      "text": "在湖南长沙岳麓山的清风峡里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00015",
      "start_ms": 46440,
      "end_ms": 48420,
      "text": "他修在清朝乾隆年间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00016",
      "start_ms": 49060,
      "end_ms": 50700,
      "text": "原先叫红叶亭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00017",
      "start_ms": 50980,
      "end_ms": 51720,
      "text": "高九米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00018",
      "start_ms": 52200,
      "end_ms": 54520,
      "text": "顶上铺着绿油油的琉璃瓦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00019",
      "start_ms": 55060,
      "end_ms": 56440,
      "text": "八根红大柱子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00020",
      "start_ms": 56540,
      "end_ms": 58660,
      "text": "稳稳顶着四角飞檐。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00021",
      "start_ms": 59080,
      "end_ms": 64100,
      "text": "后来的关缘取杜牧停车坐爱枫林晚的名句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00022",
      "start_ms": 64400,
      "end_ms": 65995,
      "text": "改名叫爱婉亭。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00023",
      "start_ms": 66450,
      "end_ms": 71340,
      "text": "您要是秋天去傍晚的光打在红叶上风一过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00024",
      "start_ms": 71620,
      "end_ms": 73345,
      "text": "叶子落进亭子里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00025",
      "start_ms": 73920,
      "end_ms": 77065,
      "text": "杜牧那句诗就在脑子里自己跑出来了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00026",
      "start_ms": 77560,
      "end_ms": 78805,
      "text": "这不是背课文，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00027",
      "start_ms": 79290,
      "end_ms": 81765,
      "text": "这是脚踩进诗里的感觉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00028",
      "start_ms": 82340,
      "end_ms": 85115,
      "text": "年轻世子在这儿指点江山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00029",
      "start_ms": 85470,
      "end_ms": 86345,
      "text": "激扬文字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00030",
      "start_ms": 86770,
      "end_ms": 87230,
      "text": "诗情，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00031",
      "start_ms": 87350,
      "end_ms": 88355,
      "text": "融进山水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00032",
      "start_ms": 88830,
      "end_ms": 90745,
      "text": "文胆皆续文脉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00033",
      "start_ms": 91150,
      "end_ms": 92985,
      "text": "在这站上一炷香的功夫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00034",
      "start_ms": 93330,
      "end_ms": 96135,
      "text": "整个人都被书卷墨香浸透了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00035",
      "start_ms": 96980,
      "end_ms": 98735,
      "text": "您说他能不流传千古吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00036",
      "start_ms": 99120,
      "end_ms": 99745,
      "text": "第四名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00037",
      "start_ms": 100180,
      "end_ms": 103925,
      "text": "陶然亭在北京城南先农坛的西边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00038",
      "start_ms": 104320,
      "end_ms": 105695,
      "text": "清朝康熙年间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00039",
      "start_ms": 106220,
      "end_ms": 110815,
      "text": "一位管工程的官员江早在这盖了三间小草亭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00040",
      "start_ms": 111220,
      "end_ms": 114775,
      "text": "借白居易共君一醉一桃然的诗句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00041",
      "start_ms": 115140,
      "end_ms": 116255,
      "text": "给他起了名字。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00042",
      "start_ms": 116680,
      "end_ms": 118395,
      "text": "在整整两百多年里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00043",
      "start_ms": 118750,
      "end_ms": 123845,
      "text": "各地进京赶考的举子文人只要科举落了榜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00044",
      "start_ms": 124720,
      "end_ms": 127035,
      "text": "或者要卷铺盖离开京城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00045",
      "start_ms": 127480,
      "end_ms": 129945,
      "text": "全都会跑到这儿来借酒浇愁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00046",
      "start_ms": 130370,
      "end_ms": 131730,
      "text": "您说这样的地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00047",
      "start_ms": 131870,
      "end_ms": 133455,
      "text": "它哪里只是一座亭？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00048",
      "start_ms": 133910,
      "end_ms": 137045,
      "text": "他是北京文人两百年的出气口，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00049",
      "start_ms": 137460,
      "end_ms": 139455,
      "text": "落脚点散心的地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00050",
      "start_ms": 139810,
      "end_ms": 140645,
      "text": "第三名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00051",
      "start_ms": 141080,
      "end_ms": 144065,
      "text": "湖心亭就站在西湖正中央。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00052",
      "start_ms": 144630,
      "end_ms": 145875,
      "text": "四面都是水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00053",
      "start_ms": 146540,
      "end_ms": 147805,
      "text": "四面都是山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00054",
      "start_ms": 148650,
      "end_ms": 150275,
      "text": "夏天来是热闹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00055",
      "start_ms": 150680,
      "end_ms": 152045,
      "text": "冬天落了大雪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00056",
      "start_ms": 152380,
      "end_ms": 154340,
      "text": "就是另一个世界张岱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00057",
      "start_ms": 154340,
      "end_ms": 157480,
      "text": "在湖心亭看学里写过崇祯五年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00058",
      "start_ms": 157560,
      "end_ms": 159025,
      "text": "大雪下了三天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00059",
      "start_ms": 159750,
      "end_ms": 161850,
      "text": "他半夜一个人撑着小船，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00060",
      "start_ms": 161990,
      "end_ms": 164715,
      "text": "出门看雪山是白的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00061",
      "start_ms": 165110,
      "end_ms": 166115,
      "text": "亭是白的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00062",
      "start_ms": 166700,
      "end_ms": 168815,
      "text": "天地之间像是被抹平了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00063",
      "start_ms": 169210,
      "end_ms": 170235,
      "text": "到了亭上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00064",
      "start_ms": 170580,
      "end_ms": 171945,
      "text": "居然还有两个人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00065",
      "start_ms": 172340,
      "end_ms": 173520,
      "text": "三个人围着炉子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00066",
      "start_ms": 173520,
      "end_ms": 175755,
      "text": "把酒喝完各自散的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00067",
      "start_ms": 176200,
      "end_ms": 177365,
      "text": "连名字都没留。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00068",
      "start_ms": 178050,
      "end_ms": 179685,
      "text": "这篇文章不到两百字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00069",
      "start_ms": 180240,
      "end_ms": 187055,
      "text": "却是中国文学史上写孤独写的最干净的一篇张岱是在明朝亡了之后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00070",
      "start_ms": 187620,
      "end_ms": 190070,
      "text": "借着旧日的雪重写，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00071",
      "start_ms": 190250,
      "end_ms": 192045,
      "text": "回不去的那个世界。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00072",
      "start_ms": 192810,
      "end_ms": 197175,
      "text": "湖心亭的文人气是孤独到极致，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00073",
      "start_ms": 197670,
      "end_ms": 199615,
      "text": "却又孤独的那么干净。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00074",
      "start_ms": 199950,
      "end_ms": 200570,
      "text": "第二名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00075",
      "start_ms": 200790,
      "end_ms": 204985,
      "text": "醉翁亭在安徽滁州的狼牙山腰上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00076",
      "start_ms": 205760,
      "end_ms": 207275,
      "text": "北宋庆历年间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00077",
      "start_ms": 207770,
      "end_ms": 212655,
      "text": "琅牙寺的和尚特意为欧阳修盖了这座歇山小青瓦亭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00078",
      "start_ms": 213410,
      "end_ms": 216470,
      "text": "远远看去就像一只展翅的大鸟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00079",
      "start_ms": 216650,
      "end_ms": 218065,
      "text": "立在泉水边上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00080",
      "start_ms": 218480,
      "end_ms": 219475,
      "text": "醉翁亭不大，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00081",
      "start_ms": 219990,
      "end_ms": 223310,
      "text": "在山边旁边有古树遮阴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00082",
      "start_ms": 223610,
      "end_ms": 224905,
      "text": "一进去就凉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00083",
      "start_ms": 225370,
      "end_ms": 227715,
      "text": "欧阳修在这儿不是一个人喝闷酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00084",
      "start_ms": 228270,
      "end_ms": 230175,
      "text": "他是带着老百姓一起来的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00085",
      "start_ms": 230780,
      "end_ms": 234450,
      "text": "游山宴隐看、射、听音乐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00086",
      "start_ms": 234810,
      "end_ms": 235575,
      "text": "热热闹闹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00087",
      "start_ms": 235980,
      "end_ms": 238615,
      "text": "把被贬的日子过成了嘉年华。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00088",
      "start_ms": 239070,
      "end_ms": 241325,
      "text": "这种豁达不是装出来的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00089",
      "start_ms": 241790,
      "end_ms": 244625,
      "text": "是他真的把与民同乐这四个字落了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00090",
      "start_ms": 245320,
      "end_ms": 245760,
      "text": "后来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00091",
      "start_ms": 245760,
      "end_ms": 249360,
      "text": "宋朝文人但凡提到贬官文化必提，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00092",
      "start_ms": 249420,
      "end_ms": 254325,
      "text": "欧阳修必提醉翁亭一篇记一座亭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00093",
      "start_ms": 254840,
      "end_ms": 259035,
      "text": "让醉翁这两个字从贬义变成了境界。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00094",
      "start_ms": 259650,
      "end_ms": 262805,
      "text": "您说这样的亭子应不应该晋榜？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00095",
      "start_ms": 263200,
      "end_ms": 267200,
      "text": "可就算是醉翁亭在文人气这件事上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00096",
      "start_ms": 267550,
      "end_ms": 270285,
      "text": "也还有一座亭子排在他前面。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00097",
      "start_ms": 270690,
      "end_ms": 271190,
      "text": "第一名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00098",
      "start_ms": 271530,
      "end_ms": 275765,
      "text": "兰亭在浙江绍兴的兰竹山脚下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00099",
      "start_ms": 276560,
      "end_ms": 282655,
      "text": "为什么是他在他面前所有的亭子都只能算后辈？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00100",
      "start_ms": 283090,
      "end_ms": 284970,
      "text": "公元三百五十三年三月初，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00101",
      "start_ms": 284970,
      "end_ms": 287375,
      "text": "三东晋永和九年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00102",
      "start_ms": 287990,
      "end_ms": 297075,
      "text": "会稽内使王羲之邀集谢安孙绰等四十一位文人名士在兰主山下取水流觞。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00103",
      "start_ms": 297570,
      "end_ms": 298530,
      "text": "饮酒作诗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00104",
      "start_ms": 298950,
      "end_ms": 301410,
      "text": "王羲之带着微醺醉意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00105",
      "start_ms": 302110,
      "end_ms": 303330,
      "text": "拿起蜀虚笔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00106",
      "start_ms": 303370,
      "end_ms": 305770,
      "text": "在残简纸上一气呵成，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00107",
      "start_ms": 306450,
      "end_ms": 311650,
      "text": "写下了被誉为天下第一行书的兰亭集序。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00108",
      "start_ms": 312070,
      "end_ms": 313250,
      "text": "两千多年来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00109",
      "start_ms": 313630,
      "end_ms": 315350,
      "text": "任凭兵荒马乱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00110",
      "start_ms": 315670,
      "end_ms": 320070,
      "text": "朝代更迭多少殿堂楼阁化为灰烬。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00111",
      "start_ms": 320810,
      "end_ms": 324150,
      "text": "兰亭园址也历经多次迁建，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00112",
      "start_ms": 324610,
      "end_ms": 326130,
      "text": "可兰亭这两个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00113",
      "start_ms": 326610,
      "end_ms": 334300,
      "text": "早就从从一座具体的江南牧亭化作了全体中国文人心头不灭的图腾。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00114",
      "start_ms": 334760,
      "end_ms": 337160,
      "text": "您坐在兰亭的鹅池边上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00115",
      "start_ms": 337580,
      "end_ms": 339800,
      "text": "看着眼前蜿蜒的溪流，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00116",
      "start_ms": 340220,
      "end_ms": 342540,
      "text": "听着竹林里的清风细雨。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00117",
      "start_ms": 342920,
      "end_ms": 348180,
      "text": "当年那群魏晋风流名仕听对生死无常发出的喟叹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00118",
      "start_ms": 348500,
      "end_ms": 352240,
      "text": "至今依然顺着流水撞击在您的心口。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00119",
      "start_ms": 352680,
      "end_ms": 353800,
      "text": "它排在榜首，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00120",
      "start_ms": 354160,
      "end_ms": 356280,
      "text": "不是因为建筑有多宏伟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00121",
      "start_ms": 356280,
      "end_ms": 361185,
      "text": "而是是因为在这座亭子下诞生的风骨与墨香，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00122",
      "start_ms": 361710,
      "end_ms": 365655,
      "text": "直接定义了中国传统文人的最高精神品格。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00123",
      "start_ms": 366190,
      "end_ms": 368155,
      "text": "十座名亭全讲完了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00124",
      "start_ms": 368720,
      "end_ms": 371840,
      "text": "真趣亭带着江南的灵动吹台，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00125",
      "start_ms": 371860,
      "end_ms": 374155,
      "text": "把湖光山色悄悄借走。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00126",
      "start_ms": 374790,
      "end_ms": 377475,
      "text": "放鹤亭带人逃离官场牢笼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00127",
      "start_ms": 377990,
      "end_ms": 380445,
      "text": "丰乐亭装满了天下人的保暖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00128",
      "start_ms": 380930,
      "end_ms": 383635,
      "text": "沧浪亭立着不肯服软的骨气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00129",
      "start_ms": 384110,
      "end_ms": 386210,
      "text": "艾婉亭染透了书卷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00130",
      "start_ms": 386250,
      "end_ms": 390135,
      "text": "诗意陶然亭盛满了游子的心酸。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00131",
      "start_ms": 390760,
      "end_ms": 393545,
      "text": "醉翁亭教人看淡人生的起落，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00132",
      "start_ms": 394000,
      "end_ms": 394720,
      "text": "湖心亭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00133",
      "start_ms": 394820,
      "end_ms": 396695,
      "text": "守着血液里的一腔孤傲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00134",
      "start_ms": 397140,
      "end_ms": 400385,
      "text": "可只有兰亭不是一个人的故事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00135",
      "start_ms": 400850,
      "end_ms": 404225,
      "text": "而是四十一个人共同立下的一块碑。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00136",
      "start_ms": 404800,
      "end_ms": 406375,
      "text": "他告诉所有文人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00137",
      "start_ms": 406730,
      "end_ms": 408455,
      "text": "什么叫真正的惧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00138",
      "start_ms": 408910,
      "end_ms": 410355,
      "text": "什么叫真正的雅？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00139",
      "start_ms": 410870,
      "end_ms": 414845,
      "text": "什么叫把一个好日子过成往后一千年的标准？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00140",
      "start_ms": 415520,
      "end_ms": 416905,
      "text": "您说什么叫文人气？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00141",
      "start_ms": 417370,
      "end_ms": 418970,
      "text": "最顶级的文人气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00142",
      "start_ms": 419590,
      "end_ms": 421430,
      "text": "从来不是雕梁画栋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00143",
      "start_ms": 421610,
      "end_ms": 422810,
      "text": "修的有多气派，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00144",
      "start_ms": 423510,
      "end_ms": 426150,
      "text": "而是即便肉身化作尘土，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00145",
      "start_ms": 426570,
      "end_ms": 430410,
      "text": "那股寄情山水、超然物外的精神香火，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00146",
      "start_ms": 430750,
      "end_ms": 433630,
      "text": "依然能在后人心中代代相传。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00147",
      "start_ms": 434110,
      "end_ms": 435190,
      "text": "最后问您一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00148",
      "start_ms": 435630,
      "end_ms": 436990,
      "text": "这十座亭子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00149",
      "start_ms": 437490,
      "end_ms": 441390,
      "text": "您去过哪几座哪一座最让您记得住，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00150",
      "start_ms": 441770,
      "end_ms": 445070,
      "text": "想听更多中国古代的山水与文人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00151",
      "start_ms": 445370,
      "end_ms": 446150,
      "text": "点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_27d8bb6abb47e0c6_s00152",
      "start_ms": 446470,
      "end_ms": 448255,
      "text": "咱们下回接着聊。"
    }
  ],
